# CODEOWNERS — human review required for sensitive paths.
#
# Even when a change comes from an AI agent (rivvak-sg-heal[bot] etc.),
# GitHub will require review from the owners listed below before merge.
# The auto-commit-to-main allow-list in AI_AGENT_RULES.md defines paths
# where the path-guard on sg-devbox may push directly without a PR;
# every other path routes through PR + this file.

# Default fallback — everything requires @rivvak
* @rivvak

# Explicit locks on security-critical paths (redundant with the fallback
# but present so intent is unambiguous):
/auth/                         @rivvak
/server/main.py                @rivvak
/server/bot.py                 @rivvak
/server/Dockerfile             @rivvak
/.github/workflows/            @rivvak
/hashes.txt                    @rivvak
/build.bat                     @rivvak
/Dockerfile                    @rivvak
/scripts/                      @rivvak
